OKKY Spec
  
1. Menu Hierarchy & Code

네이밍 원칙 
상위 메뉴는 영문 단어 첫글자 대문자로 통일 (QNA, Knowledge, Community 등) 
하위 메뉴는 [상위메뉴명]_[영문명] 형태로 일관 (Knowledge_Tips, Community_Life 등) 
한글 메뉴명이 복합일 경우 CamelCase로 변환 (JobSeekers, CompanyReview, BoardRequest 등)

Naming Rules
Top-level menus use English words with the first letter capitalized (e.g., QNA, Knowledge, Community).
Sub-menus follow the consistent format [ParentMenuName]_[EnglishName] (e.g., Knowledge_Tips, Community_Life).
When a Korean menu name consists of multiple words, it is converted to CamelCase (e.g., JobSeekers, CompanyReview, BoardRequest).

